<title>FRANCE: TABLE-Dassault Electronique H1 sales up 9.2 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Dassault Electronique H1 sales up 9.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 2,223    vs     2,035</p>
<p>    New orders				     2,199    vs     1,643</p>
<p>    Orderbook					7,160</p>
<p>NOTE - Dassault Electronique said that 52 percent of its sales were made up of exports.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
